.th COREIT I 2/11/77
.sh NAME
coreit \*- core file analyser
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd coreit
[corefiles]
.sh DESCRIPTION
.it Coreit
analyses the content of core files and lists the  characteristics
of the process that produced it.
.s3
The default file is "core".
.sh "SEE ALSO"
core (V)
.sh DIAGNOSTICS
"no such file" and "invalid file" both self explanatory.
.sh AUTHOR
Craig McGregor (University of New South Wales)
.sh BUGS
